{title: Holy ghost revival}

{comment: Chorus}
We need an old fashioned Heaven sent Holy ghost revival
Touching me, touching you
We need that sin erasing, restorartion, Holy Ghost revival
Send it Lord, our soul’s renewed

{comment: Verse 1}
The church has learned to make things happen on the natural side.
All our buildings and our programs have not turned the tide.
This is warfare and our weapons, faith the Word and love.
Need a fresh anointing from above.

{comment: Verse 2}
If we want the power God has promised at the last.
We won’t find it stirring in the ashes of the past.
There’s a new day a dawning pray and lift up holy hands.
Revival fires will sweet across the land.
